                1,
                2
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 159,
                "endIndex": 303,
                "text": "Both vendors and high-net-worth (HNW) purchasers rely on discrete networks, pre-qualification, and non-disclosure agreements to preserve privacy"
