                "endIndex": 727,
                "text": "**Reputation:** Brisbane’s top-producing prestige broker"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                8,
                1
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 729,
                "endIndex": 933,
                "text": "Matt Lancashire launched *Collective Luxury* specifically to handle sales above $4 million, backed by a proprietary database of thousands of vetted HNW individuals, returning expats, and interstate buyers"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                1
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 935,
                "endIndex": 1037,
                "text": "He routinely negotiates multi-million and street-record sales privately without public campaign assets"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                8,
                7
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 1108,
                "endIndex": 1190,
                "text": "**Pockets:** Hawthorne, Bulimba, Kangaroo Point, New Farm, and absolute riverfront"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                9,
                10,
                11
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 1196,
                "endIndex": 1292,
                "text": "**Reputation:** Widely regarded as the leading authority on Brisbane’s prime riverfront market"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                9,
                12
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 1294,
                "endIndex": 1432,
                "text": "With over two decades in high-end sales, Sarah Hackett manages a private network of business leaders, developers, and corporate executives"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                9,
                13
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 1434,
                "endIndex": 1547,
                "text": "Her team regularly places buyers into landmark riverside residences well before completion or public announcement"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                11
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 1594,
                "endIndex": 1684,
                "text": "**Pockets:** Indooroopilly, Chelmer, Graceville, Fig Tree Pocket, St Lucia, and Paddington"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                14,
                15
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 1690,
                "endIndex": 1759,
                "text": "**Reputation:** Repeatedly ranked Queensland’s #1 residential agent"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                14,
                16
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 1761,
